      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Read path",
      "items": [
        "Reads dwarf writes \u2014 the read path never touches the primary business DB directly",
        "Purpose-built spatial index, in memory / Redis-backed, serves sub-100ms queries"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Two-phase filter",
      "items": [
        "Geohash prefix + 8 neighbour cells give a cheap coarse candidate set",
        "Exact Haversine distance runs only on that small set, never the whole DB"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Index freshness",
      "items": [
        "Writes are rare, so the index rebuilds asynchronously \u2014 lag of seconds to minutes is fine",
